# <type>(<scope>): <subject> [T<phase>-<number>]
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Header: Imperative, present tense, <= 72 characters.
# Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore
# Scope: sensor, image, seg, fusion, rec, api, frontend, data, devops, etc.
# Example: feat(sensor): audit lettuce sensor dataset splits [T2-005]
#
# --- WHAT & WHY ---
# What changed and why was this change necessary?
# - 

# --- TESTS RUN ---
# Which tests/checks were executed? (Never claim passing without running!)
# - Commands run: 
# - Result: 

# --- SPLITS & DATA TOUCHED ---
# Were any dataset splits, source CSVs, or manifests touched? (Yes / No)
# - Splits touched: No (splits are frozen)
# - Details: 

# --- METRICS ---
# If applicable, state exact split name, metric name, and measured value.
# (e.g. test set macro-F1: 0.942, val accuracy: 0.958)
# - Split: 
# - Metric: 

# --- LIMITATIONS & CAVEATS ---
# Known edge cases, caveats, or deferred requirements.
# - None

# --- LEARNING FOCUS NOTE ---
# Link to relevant learning note if this task had a Learning Focus.
# - Concept note: docs/learning/...
